==French==

===Etymology===
Probably from {{etyl|LL.|fr}} {{m|la||*(in) hanc hora|until this hour}} < {{etyl|la|fr}} {{m|la|hanc}} {{m|la|hora}}. Compare Occitan {{m|oc|encara}}, Italian {{m|it|ancora}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ɑ̃.kɔʁ/|lang=fr}}
* {{audio|fr-encore.ogg|Audio (France)|lang=fr}}

===Adverb===
{{fr-adv}}

# [[still]]
#: ''Êtes-vous '''encore''' là?''
#:: Are you '''still''' there?
# [[more]]
#: ''Voulez-vous '''encore''' du pain ?''
#:: Would you like '''more''' bread?
#: ''Tu en veux '''encore'''?''
#:: You want some '''more'''?
# [[again]]
#: '''''Encore''' une fois.''
#:: Once '''again'''.
# [[yet]]
#: ''Je n'ai pas '''encore''' fini.''
#:: I haven't finished '''yet'''

